{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44268","headline":"暮春即事 · 鱼玄机","name":"暮春即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深巷穷门少侣俦，阮郎唯有梦中留。\n香飘罗绮谁家席，风送歌声何处楼。\n街近鼓鼙喧晓睡，庭闲鹊语乱春愁。\n安能追逐人间事，万里身同不系舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}